+__PRIVATE_CAPTURE_WORKSPACE__/SIH/.venv/bin/python research/robustness/learned/src/run_development_completeness.py
+```
+
+Outcome:
+
+```text
+matrix exact=20/28  wrong_valid=1  abstain=7
+unmarked valid=1/2
+unissued identities accepted by registry receiver=0
+```
+
+The wrong-valid case was `dev_memo/B` under scanner bilevel: the decoder produced a valid but unregistered BCH message 36 bits from the target. The unmarked `dev_table` source also produced a valid unregistered result, 29 bits from its target. Retaining both findings is deliberate: decoder/ECC validity is not authentication. Across all six sources at selected strength 1.0, the aggregate was 63/84 exact, one wrong-valid unissued output, and 20 abstentions; one of six unmarked sources decoded validly, while the frozen registry accepted zero unissued identities.
+
+## Gated print candidate and PDF QA
+
+After confirmation, a named packaging-only script replaced the source page's misleading unmarked-reference footer with a visible research-candidate banner. This local post-embedding overlay changed footer pixels, but it did not re-embed, retune, or change the frozen message:
+
+```text
+__PRIVATE_CAPTURE_WORKSPACE__/SIH/.venv/bin/python research/robustness/learned/src/package_print_candidate.py
+```
+
+Verification:
+
+```text
+candidate=results/print_candidate_test_mixed_A_strength_1p0.pdf
+pages=1  media=595x842 pt  raster=1190x1684  bytes=228674
+sha256=cb92f99abf65de7174476328fe377a4be1a9ff2e8783a4f286a92538347ba944
+labelled PNG exact=true
+PDF 144-DPI round-trip exact=true
+repeat packaging PDF hash identical=true
+fonts=none  selectable text=none
+```
+
+Poppler rendering and visual inspection found the complete A4 page and banner with no clipping or overlap. The artifact is raster-only. It is eligible for at most one new matching print only if the coordinator authorizes and preregisters a matched physical pack; it is not evidence of a successful print/camera path.
+
+## Final retained footprint
+
+```text
+branch-local runtime/models/cache=1292885068 bytes
+retained research results=1068932 bytes
+ignored working images=56768549 bytes
+overall sampled child peak RSS=350516 KiB
+```
+
+All remain below the campaign's storage and memory limits. No GPU or training process was used.
